Vendored Material file-icon subset for Kubecode (ADR 0209)
==========================================================

The SVG files under src/kubecode/icons/material/svg/ (except the four
baseline assets listed below) and the generated manifest.ts bodies are
derived from the Material Icon Theme:

    https://github.com/material-extensions/vscode-material-icon-theme

pinned at commit 48a530c7a849d902deafa805a27c13fec731de3c and licensed
under the MIT License (full text follows). The audited subset is defined
by scripts/material-icons/audit-list.json; regeneration is deterministic
via `pnpm icons:material`.

Local modifications applied on top of the upstream sources:
  - outer <svg> shells are stripped and re-rendered deterministically;
  - upstream hex fills are rewritten to var(--material-<color>-<shade>)
    design tokens (see src/index.css);
  - `-open` folder variants are derived locally with the open-folder
    path transform ported from upstream
    src/scripts/svg/generateOpenFolderIcons.ts.

Baseline assets authored for Kubecode (not present upstream, which
generates them at build time): file.svg, folder.svg, folder-open.svg,
folder-root.svg under scripts/material-icons/assets/.

